 Rescue actions are naturally replicated, training effectiveness becomes visible, and instructional quality and emergency response efficiency are greatly enhanced \u2014 ushering in a new era of emergency simulation training.\n\nIf you have any questions, suggestions, or wish to exercise your privacy rights, please contact us at:\nhuagingofficial@gmail.com", "short_description": "Experience immersive MR emergency training with advanced hand tracking and instant feedback \u2014 empowering you to learn critical life-saving skills with speed and precision.\n\nCombining MR, gesture tracking, and real-time feedback, our system offers intuitive emergency training while recording each session to improve learning outcomes, accuracy, and on-site rescue confidence."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.huaging.com/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "HUAGING", "support_website_url": "https://www.huaging.com/collections/cpr-and-aed", "website_url": "https://www.huaging.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "478089301798119"}, {"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "zh_TW", "vi", "id"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24123505383946852"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1049149606794692"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1049149606794692"}, "is_approved": true, "fi